Subject: [PATCH] urltest: optional confirmation before returning failed members

Omitted fallback_recovery preserves the author policy. Configured recovery
requires spaced successful probes and a minimum healthy period; another
failure resets both. Manual probe bursts, canceled probes, and stale history
cannot bypass it. Confirmation yields to the only responding path when all
stable alternatives are down. The state is per-group and memory-only.

---
